# glass-auto - environment variables (example)
#
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in the real values.
# ".env" is never committed. "ws save" keeps a copy in CLAUDE-SYNC\env\glass-auto\
#
# NOTE: save this file as UTF-8. Do not use PowerShell Add-Content without
#       -Encoding UTF8, it writes ANSI and will corrupt non-ASCII values.

# API_KEY=your_key_here
# DB_PATH=data\glass-auto.db
